---
description: Never auto-publish this folder to GitHub Pages
alwaysApply: true
---

Editing files in this folder must NOT commit and must NOT push.

Do not publish unless the user explicitly says to publish a test or to run Push update. Never push production `scan.js` as a side effect of editing the folder.

The good bookmark loads `https://nelurs.github.io/dbi-leader-dashboard/scan.js`. The test bookmark loads `https://nelurs.github.io/dbi-leader-dashboard/scan-test.js`. Experiments stay in `scan-test.js`.

`scan.js` changes only when the user runs the Push update GitHub Action (`.github/workflows/promote-scan.yml`). That workflow is `workflow_dispatch` only. Do not add a `push` or `pull_request` trigger. Do not copy `scan-test.js` over `scan.js` from a hook, a save, or a local script.

Never force-push. Never update git config. Never commit secrets. Never skip hooks.
